---
// Orange gradient "about" band.
---

<section class="band pad" id="about">
  <div class="wrap center">
    <h2>We've run programs. We built the tool we always wanted.</h2>
    <p>
      Athletic Connect is basketball-first, built by people who have run
      programs, because the best youth sports software should give directors
      and coaches their time back, not add another system to babysit.
    </p>
    <a href="/about/" class="more">Read our story →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .band {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--orange), var(--orange-2));
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .band h2 {
    color: #fff;
  }
  .band p {
    color: #fff;
    opacity: 0.95;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .band .more {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .band .more:hover {
    border-bottom-color: #fff;
  }
</style>
